<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Boîte de réception - Gmail</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Roboto', Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: #f6f8fc;
        }

        .header {
            background: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        .logo-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .gmail-logo {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #5f6368;
            margin-right: 16px;
        }

        .search-bar {
            background: #f1f3f4;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            width: 720px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .search-bar input {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            outline: none;
            width: 100%;
            margin-left: 8px;
        }

        .user-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .user-avatar {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #1a73e8;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            max-width: 1440px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .sidebar {
            width: 256px;
            background: white;
            height: calc(100vh - 64px);
            padding: 16px;
        }

        .compose-btn {
            background: #c2e7ff;
            color: #001d35;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .menu-item {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 0 16px 16px 0;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .menu-item.active {
            background: #d3e3fd;
            color: #001d35;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            background: white;
            margin: 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .email-list {
            padding: 8px 0;
        }

        .email-item {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f3f4;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .email-item:hover {
            background: #f5f7f7;
        }

        .email-sender {
            font-weight: 500;
            min-width: 200px;
        }

        .email-subject {
            font-weight: 500;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .email-preview {
            color: #5f6368;
            flex: 2;
        }

        .email-time {
            color: #5f6368;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .welcome-message {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            color: #5f6368;
        }

        .welcome-title {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: #202124;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="logo-section">
            <div class="gmail-logo">Gmail</div>
            <div class="search-bar">
                <span>🔍</span>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Rechercher dans les e-mails">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="user-section">
            <div class="user-avatar" id="userAvatar">U</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="sidebar">
            <button class="compose-btn">
                <span>+</span>
                Nouveau message
            </button>
            <div class="menu-item active">
                <span>📥</span>
                Boîte de réception
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>⭐</span>
                Important
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>📤</span>
                Messages envoyés
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>📝</span>
                Brouillons
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="main-content">
            <div class="welcome-message">
                <div class="welcome-title">Bienvenue dans Gmail</div>
                <p>Votre boîte de réception est vide, mais ne vous inquiétez pas - vos e-mails arriveront bientôt !</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="email-list">
                <!-- Les emails apparaîtraient ici en temps normal -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Récupérer l'email pour l'avatar
        const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
        const email = urlParams.get('email');
        
        if (email) {
            document.getElementById('userAvatar').textContent = email.charAt(0).toUpperCase();
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
